codex
I’ve isolated the failure: this sandbox denies a process access to its numeric `/proc/<pid>/exe` link, while Lean 4.22 uses that link to locate its installation. I’m applying a narrow temporary compatibility shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that only supplies the pinned executable path for Lean-family processes; it does not alter any input or generated artifact. This is solely to let the trusted preflight perform its clean build.
apply patch
